@startuml
title GET /admin/upload/course/video/presign
actor Client
participant "Gin Router" as Router
participant "JWT Auth" as JWTAuth
participant "Admin Guard" as AdminGuard
participant "Audit Log" as AuditLog
participant "Controller" as Controller
participant "Service" as Service
participant "Repository" as Repo
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "COS" as COS

Client -> Router: HTTP GET /admin/upload/course/video/presign
Router -> JWTAuth: Validate JWT
JWTAuth --> Router: User context
Router -> AdminGuard: Require admin role
AdminGuard --> Router: Authorized
Router -> AuditLog: Start audit record
AuditLog --> Router: Trace ID
Router -> Controller: Handle request
Controller -> Service: Execute use-case
Service -> COS: External request
COS --> Service: Response
Service -> Repo: Read/Write data
Repo -> DB: SQL query
DB --> Repo: Result
Repo --> Service: Aggregate result
Service --> Controller: DTO/result
Controller --> Router: Response
Router --> Client: JSON response
@enduml
